WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.680
If you're on a split dose prep, it's time to walk through your second dose.

2
00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:08.370
Confirm with your written instructions. Split dosing means you take the first

3
00:00:08.370 --> 00:00:08.880
half of your

4
00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:12.400
prep the evening before and the second half the morning of your procedure,

5
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:14.080
typically six hours

6
00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:18.510
before your arrival time. When you wake up tomorrow, mix and drink your second

7
00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:19.600
dose as directed on

8
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:24.020
your prep instructions. Continue drinking clear liquids after your dose until

9
00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:24.800
the cut-off time

10
00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:28.960
we've specified. Your goal is to keep going until your output runs clear. That's

11
00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:29.600
how we know your

12
00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:33.040
prep is working. If you have any concerns about how things are going, call our

13
00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:33.760
office first thing

14
00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:35.200
in the morning. You're almost done.
